<BaseLayout title="Help us build around a real trading day." description="The founding pilot is in preparation. We are looking for a small group of merchants to test a focused workflow.">
<PageHero eyebrow="Founding merchants" title="Help us build around a real trading day." lede="The founding pilot is in preparation. We are looking for a small group of merchants to test a focused workflow." />
<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 prose-kora">
<h2>Who fits the first pilot</h2>
<p>One stock location, countable physical products and a merchant willing to confirm opening quantities and review exceptions. Online-only sellers and physical shops are both relevant.</p>
<h2>What we want to test</h2>
<p>Catalogue import, variants, reservations, payment verification, receipts and fulfilment. The measure is whether the records agree with real sales and physical stock.</p>
<h2>How it starts</h2>
<p>Discuss your workflow, agree scope and pricing, then confirm access and timing. Expressing interest does not start a subscription or guarantee immediate onboarding.</p>
<h2>What is not a case study</h2>
<p>Ada’s Store and other demo businesses are fictional examples. We have not published verified customer results or time-saving claims.</p>
<p><a href="/pilot" class="btn btn-primary">Explore the founding pilot</a></p>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
